\code{PlySummarizedExperiment} objects, \code{...} specifies the \code{rows()} and/or
\code{cols()} contexts to slice, and these expressions must be empty:

\if{html}{\out{<div class="sourceCode r">}}\preformatted{slice_head(xp, rows(), n = 1)
